<book xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace" xml:id="ps3_8">
  <chapter xml:id="chapter_8">
    <title>PS3.8 Synthetic Network</title>
    <section xml:id="sect_8_1">
      <title>Association PDU Behavior Overview</title>
      <para>Synthetic PS3.8 fixture for generic DocBook ingestion. The A-ASSOCIATE-RQ PDU starts association establishment so peer DICOM AEs can negotiate presentation contexts before DIMSE messages are exchanged.</para>
      <table xml:id="table_8-1">
        <title>Synthetic Association PDUs</title>
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <thead>
            <row><entry>PDU</entry><entry>Direction</entry><entry>Behavior</entry></row>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <row><entry>A-ASSOCIATE-RQ</entry><entry>request</entry><entry>Starts association establishment by proposing presentation contexts.</entry></row>
            <row><entry>A-ASSOCIATE-AC</entry><entry>response</entry><entry>Accepts association establishment with negotiated presentation contexts.</entry></row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
      <table xml:id="table_8-2">
        <title>Synthetic Network Notes</title>
        <tgroup cols="2">
          <thead>
            <row><entry>Topic</entry><entry>Rule</entry></row>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <row><entry>Connection Establishment</entry><entry>Prose-only rule.</entry></row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </section>
  </chapter>
</book>
